00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:46,000
In Darkness is a 2018 thriller film directed by Anthony
Byrne and written by Byrne and Natalie Dormer.

11
01:02:20,000 --> 01:02:26,000
It stars Dormer, Ed Skrein, Emily Ratajkowski and Joely Richardson.

12
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
